# PLACEHOLDER — NoMercy release-signing public key not yet configured.
#
# Replace this entire file with the ASCII-armored PGP public key exported from
# the org's release-signing key:
#
#   gpg --armor --export <signing-key-id> > nomercy-public-key.asc
#
# Until a real key is embedded, BinaryVerification.LoadEmbeddedPublicKey() treats
# this file as "not configured" and manifest signature verification is skipped
# (a warning is logged). SHA-256 integrity checks from the manifest still run.
